others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"load_configs 函数就是用来加载配置文件的，配置文件的路径默认是 /app/config/config.yaml，\n但是可以通过环境变量 CONFIG_PATH 来指定配置文件的路径。"},"226":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-19","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"有了配置的识别逻辑，我们就可以创建一个函数来返回所有的代理规则"},"227":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-20","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"这个方法用来从配置里解析出所有的反向代理地址，并返回一个 map，key 是路由，\nvalue 是LoadBalancer。这个是用来做代理关键的组件。"},"228":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-21","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"定义MyProxy，并实现 ProxyHttp trait。MyProxy的属性有两个，一个是 lbs，\n是一个代理路径到上游服务器的映射。现在开始实现 upstream_peer 方法。"},"229":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-22","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"方法里就是获取请求的路径，然后检查是否有任何路由键是当前请求路径的前缀。如果有就\n替换匹配的部分路径，构建新的 path 和 query string，然后构建新的 Uri，并设置到\nsession 的请求头里。\n至此我们就完成了反向代理的逻辑。实际这个匹配其实还是有优化空间的，后续我再优化。\n完整代码参看前面给的代码样板地址。"},"230":{"id":"/docs/others/socks5service","page_id":"/docs/others/socks5service","type":"page","content":"socks5服务搭建","tags":[],"url":"/docs/others/socks5service"},"231":{"id":"/docs/others/socks5service-0","page_id":"/docs/others/socks5service","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/socks5service","content":"为了方便给住宅 ip 做前置节点，找一个 vps 搭建一个 socks5 服务"},"232":{"id":"/docs/others/socks5service-1","page_id":"/docs/others/socks5service","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/others/socks5service#socks5-节点搭建方案笔记","content":"Socks5 节点搭建方案笔记"},"233":{"id":"/docs/others/socks5service-2","page_id":"/docs/others/socks5service","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/others/socks5service#1-需求分析","content":"1. 需求分析"},"234":{"id":"/docs/others/socks5service-3","page_id":"/docs/others/socks5service","type